Adaptive bitrate for jellyfin-web: request the ladder on Auto, start a remote stream on Auto as a transcode, keep the
lowest level and every playlist loaded (a few minutes of the lowest level while the buffer is healthy), open up higher
levels once the connection carries them, switch quality in place without a restart, fetch a fragment before its init
segment, and size the buffer per level. git diff v10.11.11 of drizzelat/jellyfin-web abr-prototype.
